      "body": "## Summary\n\nFix issue #43988: `--fp4-gemm-backend marlin` crashes with NVFP4 W4A4 checkpoints on SM100.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nFP4 Marlin is a weight-only (W4A16) backend; it does **not** support W4A4 GEMM.\nWhen a user explicitly passes `--fp4-gemm-backend marlin` on Blackwell (SM100+)\nGPUs, FlashInfer's `mm_fp4` raises:\n\n```\nBackendSupportedError: mm_fp4 does not support backend 'marlin' with capability 100\n```\n\nThe existing `auto` mode already picks `flashinfer_cutedsl` on SM100, so the\ncrash only happens with an **explicit** user override of the fp4 GEMM backend.\n\n## Fix\n\nIn `initialize_fp4_gemm_config()` (`python/sglang/srt/layers/quantization/fp4_utils.py`),\nafter both auto-selection and explicit user input have been resolved, check whether\nthe chosen backend is `marlin` on a Blackwell GPU. If so, fall back to the correct\nFlashInfer dense-GEMM backend (`flashinfer_cutedsl` for SM100+ or `flashinfer_cutlass`\nfor other SM12x) and emit a clear warning explaining the situation.\n\nThis guarantees that no code path can pass `backend='marlin'` into FlashInfer's\n`mm_fp4` on unsupported hardware.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Verified the fix against a simulated SM100 platform with `--fp4-gemm-backend marlin`\n  — the server now starts cleanly, auto-falls back to `flashinfer_cutedsl`, and\n  logs the expected warning.\n- Auto-selection path is unchanged: `auto` still picks `flashinfer_cutedsl` on SM100,\n  `marlin` on SM80-SM90, and `flashinfer_cutlass` elsewhere.\n\nFixes: #43988\n\nSigned-off-by: yancy <yancy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38445301324](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38445301324)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38445300993](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38445300993)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38445301205](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38445301205)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
